{"articleNo":"131913","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=131913&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"해외우수 일자리 베스트 20(K-Move 사업) 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.07.16","hit":"2680","attachments":[{"name":"해외우수일자리 베스트20(보도자료).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=131913&attachNo=74998"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">고용노동부와 한국산업인력공단은 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우리 청년들의 해외진출을 지원하기 위해</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">훈련 및 해외인턴 기회 제공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해외취업 알선</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해외취업성공장려금 지원 등 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">「</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">K-Move </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">사업</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 추진 중에 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">해외 취업을 희망하는 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">청년들에게 양질의 일자리 정보를 제공하기 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해외 우수 일자리 베스트 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 선정하여 발표</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하였으니 첨부파일 확인바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">격주 단위로 해외 우수 일자리를 해외통합정보망인 월드잡플러스</span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.worldjob.or.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">를 통해 발표할 예정이오니 관심있는 학생들은 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
